  characterAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  combinedLines: "After surviving the trial of the colosseum, Alice was taken in
    by Captain Light. | A brief period of peace followed; they lived like family,
    taking on basic mercenary contracts just to get by. | But the Final Boss's shadow
    cast wide over this world. Plague spread, and the survivors wept in agony. |
    To save them, the two must venture into the Sylvan Shroud\u2014a cursed forest
    now occupied by the Umbral Fiends."
